• [0mOpenAI’s current guidance supports a lean prompt with each rule stated once and concise, precise tool descriptions; repeated approval language can itself cause unnecessary approval narration. I’m applying that directly: the model will remain a general
  assistant, but Agendo operations will be silent and session-oriented.

